provides two breath taking views. To the east, near the largest entrance
to the tunnel, one can see a raging whirlpool within the River Styx. The
violent water seems to suck in the blackness before spitting it out in a
sluggish flow to the north. Opposite the entrance to the cave, in the
southwest corner of the room, a small deep hole allows glimpses of a vast
swampland and ocean. Sickly vapors rise from the scenery and flow across
the water of the swampland like plagues of foul insects.
